guide forever/class/warlock/felhunter-alliance
title Felhunter (Alliance)
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
faction Alliance
levels 30-33
zone The Barrens
keywords Summon Felhunter, Tome of the Cabal, Seeking Strahad, Strahad Farsan, Krom Stoutarm, Moldy Tome, Tattered Manuscript, Rod of Channeling, The Binding, Warlock, class pet
reward spell 691 "Summon Felhunter"
reward item 22244
why The felhunter, the demon to bring against spellcasters, and a Box of Souls for your shards.

# The felhunter for Alliance warlocks: Seeking Strahad (1798) from your
# trainer to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, Tome of the Cabal (1758, 1802, 1804)
# with Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge, and The Binding (1795) back in Ratchet.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0
# and Questie-Forever) for the givers, the tome, the chest, the rods and the
# summoning circle; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): the chain is unchanged in
# Forever and The Binding pays a Box of Souls.
# The Alliance leveling guides leave the chain out (see
# forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills): it crosses between Ratchet,
# Ironforge, the Hillsbrad coast, Thousand Needles and the Wetlands.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, and the chain starts at 30, so it has not been checked in game.

step Seeking Strahad (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 30 Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 1798 npc 6122                -- Gakin the Darkbinder

step Seeking Strahad (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 30 Lago Blackwrench, in the Forlorn Cavern, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 1798 npc 6120                -- Lago Blackwrench

step Strahad Farsan
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet is on the Barrens coast; Strahad Farsan stands on the hill in town.
  turnin 1798                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1758

step Krom Stoutarm
  zone Ironforge
  tip Krom Stoutarm stands in the Hall of Explorers.
  turnin 1758                         -- Krom Stoutarm
  accept 1802

step Moldy Tome
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Moldy Tome lies on the shore west of Southshore, past the Torn Fin murloc camps.
  collect 6931 quest 1802.1           -- Moldy Tome

step Tattered Manuscript
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The Damaged Chest lies in the canyon north of Freewind Post.
  collect 6997 quest 1802.2           -- Tattered Manuscript, in the Damaged Chest

step Krom Stoutarm
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 1802                         -- Krom Stoutarm
  accept 1804

step Rods of Channeling
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Dragonmaw Bonewarders and Shadowwarders hold the hills east of the road through the Wetlands: the rods drop from them.
  collect 6930 quest 1804.1           -- Rods of Channeling

step The Binding
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Use the Tome of the Cabal on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the felhunter to bind it.
  turnin 1804                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1795
  use 6999 @62.6,35.3                 -- Tome of the Cabal
  kill 6268 quest 1795.1              -- Summoned Felhunter
  turnin 1795                         -- Strahad Farsan: he binds the felhunter to you
